<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-dark:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#000000;">“I cannot access the official documentation link, so I cannot guarantee a hallucination-free answer. Please manually download https://xtls.github.io/llms-full.txt and upload it here. I will then answer only based on the uploaded document.”</span></span>
