<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-dark:#6796E6;--shiki-light:#0451A5;">3.</span><span style="--shiki-dark:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#000000;"> Answer only with information explicitly confirmed by the documentation.</span></span>
